---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions — CompareExcel"
  description="Terms and conditions for using CompareExcel, the client-side spreadsheet comparison tool."
  keywords="terms conditions compareexcel, compareexcel terms of use"
  ogImage="/og-image.png"
>
  <div class="py-20 bg-canvas border-b border-hairline">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
      <div class="text-center space-y-4">
        <div class="text-caption text-link">TERMS & CONDITIONS</div>
        <h1 class="text-display-lg text-ink">TERMS OF USE</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="border border-hairline bg-surface-soft p-8 space-y-8 font-serif text-body leading-relaxed text-sm">
        <h2 class="text-title-md text-ink font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">1. ACCEPTANCE OF TERMS</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using CompareExcel (the "Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Use. If you do not agree, you may not use the Service.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-title-md text-ink font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">2. CLIENT-SIDE PROCESSING & PRIVACY</h2>
        <p>
          All file parsing, comparison, and rendering occurs locally in your browser. Your spreadsheet data is never uploaded to a server, never stored by us, and never shared with third parties. You retain full ownership of your data at all times.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-title-md text-ink font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">3. NO WARRANTY</h2>
        <p>
          The Service is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranty of any kind, express or implied. We do not guarantee that the comparison results are error-free or suitable for any particular purpose. You use the Service at your own risk.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-title-md text-ink font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">4. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY</h2>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, CompareExcel and its providers shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or any loss of profits or data, arising out of your use or inability to use the Service.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-title-md text-ink font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">5. ACCEPTABLE USE</h2>
        <p>
          You agree not to use the Service for any unlawful purpose, to upload content you do not have rights to, or to attempt to reverse-engineer, interfere with, or disrupt the Service.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-title-md text-ink font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">6. CHANGES TO THESE TERMS</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Your continued use of the Service after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-title-md text-ink font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">7. CONTACT</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these terms may be directed to <a href="mailto:legal@compareexcel.com" class="text-link underline">legal@compareexcel.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
